  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to civil society in developing countries to engage in VNR processes in</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the role of civil society in the implementation, monitoring and evaluation of the 2030 Agenda and the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs), including meaningful engagement by civil society in the follow-up on the 2030 Agenda and the SDGs at the United Nations, in particular the processes related to the National Voluntary Reviews (VNRs). This includes; that national Civil Society Organisations (CSOs) are strengthened to ensure better coordination across civil society, and to better engage with governments and the UN during the VNR processes.</narrative>
  </description>
